🐛 Describe the bug
Let's look at this line of the function.
https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/blob/main/torch/distributed/fsdp/fully_sharded_data_parallel.py#L1133
Because the set itself is unordered, it is not fixed in the next function for loop after add, which will lead to some deterministic calculation problems. This problem occurs in both sharded_params and non-sharded_params. Please help to fix this problem, thanks~
An easy eaxmple for python set:
